ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tengo un poco de hambre.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Soy un
tipo sano{{TAG:0003:0001:}} y me gusta cuidarme.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} 
¿Podrías traerme cualquier {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fruta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Sí, cuenta conmigo!
No estoy por la labor

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Reden willst du? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Na gut, dann
erzähl ich dir mal was.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Ich hab Hunger.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Auf eine frische {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Frucht{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Irgendeine!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Du hast doch bestimmt Lust, mir
eine zu bringen, oder?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Na klar!
Nein, keine Lust.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Biraz karnım acıktı!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Canım taze {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}meyve{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
çekiyor! {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seçici değilim, türü fark
etmez!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Bana arka çıkar mısın?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Bana güven!
Yok, çok yoğunum.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I have a big favor
I need to ask you.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}C'mon, could you
help me out here?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I have an upset stomach,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} and it's
not improving. {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}I think I'll feel better
if I eat some {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fruit{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, though.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Seriously, any kind would work.
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}Can you bring me a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fruit{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
OK!
Sorry, I can't.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ehi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Mi aiuteresti?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ho mangiato una porzione esagerata
di {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} e ora...
... {{TAG:0003:0009:}}ho lo stomaco a pezzi. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}E non sta
migliorando. {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ma forse un po' di
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} risolverebbe il problema.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Di qualsiasi tipo. Non ho gusti
particolari. {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Puoi portarmi un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
OK!
Non posso.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Meyveyi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} sever misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Bana sorarsan bütün
meyveler sağlıklı,{{TAG:0003:0001:}} üstüne tatlı
tatlarına da bayılıyorum! {{TAG:0003:0003:}}Hele bir
de{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mükemmel meyve{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} yedin mi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ah be,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
düşününce bile ağzım sulandı!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hey,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bana bir mükemmel meyve
bulabilir misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ha,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} açık konuşayım,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}hangi tür olduğu fark etmez, tamam mı?!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Olur!
Yok, yapamam.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Conosci{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutta perfetta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
vero?! Dimmi di sì!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Quando ne mangi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} è una scarica
di adrenalina pura! Dopo, tornare
alla frutta normale è impossibile!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Dici che ho i gusti troppo raffinati?
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Io ti dico che se non mangio subito
un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutto perfetto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}... svengo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ehi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Potresti trovarmene uno?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Mi va bene qualsiasi tipo!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Per favore!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Certo!
Non posso ora.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Siempre puedo contar contigo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Te espero aquí muriéndome
de hambre, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Aw, I knew you wouldn't do it!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} I guess I have to control my
fruity appetite for today!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}¡Sabía que te ibas a rajar!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Pues nada,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} tendré que quedarme
sin fruta por hoy.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Ah, sapevo che avresti detto di no!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Beh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} per oggi mi sa che dovrò
accontentarmi di un'insalatina!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Bah! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hätte ich mir denken können,
